    "text": "countryherald.com\nwebsite\nWill County, Illinois\nWill County Road Closure: Crash Blocks Cedar Road in Homer Township\nBy Country Herald Police Reports,\n4 hours agoHomer Township, IL – Drivers in Will County are facing detours today after a traffic crash shut down a key stretch of Cedar Road. According to the Will County Sheriff’s Office, Cedar Road is currently closed between Route 6 and West Chicago Bloomington Trail in Homer Township. Deputies have advised drivers to avoid the area until further notice.",
